"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"ecf8ace1da23fe3daecc4c3aa8add2543643c2d88c034d8babdc5eb99f4d7020","event_uuid":"1a622c29-33b4-4406-a345-6de369562c15","position":{"commit_sha":"9ab9d36f5ea12b7a56168da174416019e9fe7dd8","position":"1788629924823515605-1a622c29-33b4-4406-a345-6de369562c15"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Kickoff: execute 114 grouped comment-remediation leaves under 6 stories, one independently reviewed and landed Gerrit change per leaf. Rebar MCP reads succeeded, but create_ticket later returned empty without writing; tracker writes therefore use the repo-local CLI fallback and bug skaldic-carbon-copperhead records the failure. Isolated worktree /Users/joeoakhart/comment-remediation-3e32 is at current origin/main. Initial make worktree provisioning exposed foliated-correct-arcticfox; provisioning was completed with the repository-pinned uv 0.12.7. Work is comment/docstring-only: preserve current non-obvious rationale and constraints, make no executable or assertion changes, verify every diff row-by-row plus ticket/project gates, fetch and integrate origin/main between tickets and immediately before every push, land and close each leaf before advancing, then close stories and epic bottom-up.","timestamp":1788584714944116001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan gate milestone: goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle first passed with one P6 advisory for compound acceptance criteria. Split preserve-item, consumer-contract, executable-behavior, and assertion outcomes; re-review passed clean and signed at 25d1d683e55a. Updated the delivery story and epic descriptions to independently verifiable criteria and to encode the user-required per-ticket Gerrit/main/close ordering. First delivery-story review was not admitted: GATE_CONGESTED, all 4 host slots in use; no verdict. Will retry later without force.","timestamp":1788586085751022001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Resumed at current `origin/main` `070c54e6f0ff34577c3cb66632d57387f7bddf7d` (clean fast-forward from `25d1d683e55a`). The latest delivery-story review BLOCKED on G6 because Scope preservation relied on self-authored completion comments and the migration TSV checked only path structure. Remediation is now durable: all 11 delivery leaves record an executable comment-only diff guard, per-path `git diff --check`, and `make lint`; `dendritic-irksome-raven` now requires a separate non-author reviewer to produce a leaf-linked item-by-item before/after TSV for every constraint, consumer contract, and edited comment block. Exact-string equality is explicitly excluded so concise semantic rewording remains valid. Next gate: re-review the delivery story, then the epic, claim the valid chain, and execute `goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle`.","timestamp":1788590537120397001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review milestone: `keen-alkylic-heifer` now has a signed, current, clean PASS at `a33333b8709a73b94d48dca6f9b9f42e562519f8` (no blocking, advisory, coaching, or dropped findings). The initial PASS exposed two accurate out-of-directory consumers of `bedrock.toml`; the plan now preserves both the matrix-only `deliberately blanks ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` phrase and the `take new IDs VERBATIM` instruction, with `rebar.toml`, `docs/local-dev-env.md`, ADR 0059, compose, and provider-pin tests enumerated as consumers. This representative review confirms the executable preservation commands satisfy G6.","timestamp":1788592642667189001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review milestone: `verminous-zealous-krill` received a signed clean PASS at `a33333b8709a73b94d48dca6f9b9f42e562519f8` with no blocking, advisory, coaching, dropped, or indeterminate findings. Its plan now keeps visible pull-request guidance out of the terse-comment scope, limits remediation to the hidden routing comment, and enumerates CodeQL/Dependabot cross-file consumers.","timestamp":1788593091448315001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review milestone: `classy-bicolor-owl` received a signed clean PASS at `a33333b8709a73b94d48dca6f9b9f42e562519f8` with no findings. Delivery leaves currently certified: `goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle`, `keen-alkylic-heifer`, `verminous-zealous-krill`, and `classy-bicolor-owl` (4/11).","timestamp":1788593635143772001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review milestone: `awestruck-starchy-cowbird` received a signed clean PASS at `a33333b8709a73b94d48dca6f9b9f42e562519f8` with no findings. Delivery leaves currently certified: 5/11 (`goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle`, `keen-alkylic-heifer`, `verminous-zealous-krill`, `classy-bicolor-owl`, `awestruck-starchy-cowbird`).","timestamp":1788594064986281001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit workflow preflight: authenticated account groups are Registered Users, user/Rebar Bot Nava, Contributors, and Anonymous Users; `feature-branch-drivers` is absent. Recent owner:self merged history on `main` includes changes 2664, 2662, 2663, 2658, 2661, 2660, 2659, 2657, 2645, and 2656, confirming ordinary review/Submit rights. Per AGENTS.md's fallback and the user's explicit per-child landing request, this epic will send each independently reviewable leaf to `refs/for/main`, wait for `LLM-Review +1` and `Verified +1`, submit, confirm `origin/main`, then advance before the next leaf; it will not attempt the feature-branch driver path.","timestamp":1788594171423530001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"2026-09-05: Reconfirmed uv diagnostic bug foliated-correct-arcticfox on origin/main c0199203 and added current evidence. Re-audited bitumen-canophilic-pekingese against current compose contracts; corrected false non-root claims, expanded preservation scope, and recorded focused infra verification. Filed discovered docs drift as edible-insane-mongrel (docs/gerrit-aws-setup.md), linked discovered_from the compose leaf.","timestamp":1788595107328618001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"2026-09-05 checkpoint: fetched and fast-forwarded the execution worktree to origin/main 0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e. Reconfirmed uv/worktree diagnostic bug foliated-correct-arcticfox on that commit and recorded the recurrence; MCP show_ticket remained unserved on two attempts, so local CLI fallback was used and the recurrence was added to existing bug skaldic-carbon-copperhead. Corrected TypeIgnore normalization in fumbling-enervative-bats and taurine-tardy-kite manifests. Applied independent audits to congenial-cibophobic-goosefish, tan-goldenrod-drever, and seaisland-nonliteral-tigermoth: fixed stale/false contracts, consumers, scope, semantic-matrix AC, AST/directive guards, focused suites, and make verify manifests. No repository file has been edited and no implementation ticket has been claimed yet.","timestamp":1788607305327794001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Confirmed uv/worktree diagnostic remains present on origin/main@0033662b: repository requires uv ==0.12.7 while /opt/homebrew/bin/uv is 0.12.9, and the Makefile still maps any uv venv failure to the Python-provisioning message. Existing bug foliated-correct-arcticfox already covers the defect, so no duplicate was created. MCP show_ticket stalled and then returned HTTP 502 on retry; recorded the recurrence on skaldic-carbon-copperhead and used the local CLI fallback.","timestamp":1788615146955167001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-audit milestone on origin/main@0033662b: corrected proposed-nomophobic-piranha (added test_mcp.py; 14-path impact), unmelted-cosmic-eeve (omitted anchors and zero current xfail gaps), and subdivine-dimming-fieldmouse (166-block current allowlist, corrected run_bridge --only versus compatibility --filter-local-ids, real consumers, content-only guard). All three local fallback reviews returned PASS and signed current plan-review attestations. Also confirmed current certifications for omphacite-autoimmune-pygmy, restoring-cynical-woodborer, concise-extended-salmon, gimmicky-unlimited-rook, desired-private-skink, and capillary-seared-grackle. Accepted generic P6 compound-criterion advisories because each grouped clause is jointly decided by one named evidence artifact; editing would only invalidate otherwise-current PASS attestations.","timestamp":1788616227279245001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Batch audit completed against origin/main@50716c9aed87479e4347a4daf084c9778c8793f7 (no code edits; no plan reviews started):\n\n- strange-urological-cornsnake (8455-598a-8245-4f4b): 4 review_bot files, 5 stable prose blocks.\n- base-conscious-astarte (89eb-b9dc-6f1b-4b4c): 4 commands files, 22 stable prose blocks.\n- priceless-hotheaded-annelid (c540-7c26-f979-45d8): 4 store files, 22 stable prose blocks.\n- capable-moist-coot (744b-6822-b9a6-435a): 5 files, 5 stable prose blocks.\n\nAll descriptions now use stable docstring/comment-to-code anchors, immutable before/final type_comments=True AST comparison with only ast.TypeIgnore.lineno normalized, exact inline/directive preservation, and one independent-review TSV row per edited block with immutable citations plus semantic-preservation/bloat-removal PASS. Composite old ranges were split into distinct blocks. The stale terraform range 178-183 (now executable assertions) was replaced by the intended comment anchored before _CaptureRunner. Replay-corpus helper consumption by test_plan_replay_parity.py and platform-selection consumption from tests/conftest.py were recorded. File-impact sets were confirmed exact; each ticket now carries five executable verify commands. Tickets remain open, unassigned, and unsigned because all gate slots were occupied.","timestamp":1788618419847293001},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-repair ledger — 2026-09-05\n\nApplied the completed immutable-base audit to four open leaf tickets through the rebar MCP write surface:\n\n- cordial-vulpine-piglet: replaced the description with 29 stable prose anchors, implemented-link-sync correction, AST/directive/runtime rules, exact consumers, four protected directives, and a 29-row independent TSV contract; recorded 7 verify commands (semantic, directives, paths, diff, hygiene, focused, full).\n- misogynous-demonian-fly: replaced the description with the 167-block census (165 editable), stable reducer anchors, implemented-vs-RED corrections, exact directive list, and a 165-row TSV contract; recorded the same 7 command classes over all 16 files.\n- plastery-nonblack-centipede: replaced the description with the corrected 53-block census, all 14 drift additions, renamed cursor-based marker contract, runtime-stub exclusions, and a 53-row TSV contract; recorded 7 commands over the exact 18 paths. The first 8,841-character edit triggered the admission-cap warning and was immediately superseded by a 7,055-character equivalent with no warning.\n- bronze-unrelaxed-erne: replaced the description with four stable header/docstring anchors, no-raw-editor and 429/matching corrections, MJS tail/shebang/AST rules, consumers, and a four-row TSV contract; recorded 11 commands including exact wrapper nodes, cassette self-test, and one node --check per MJS file.\n\nEvery description distinguishes immutable prose basis origin/main@0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e from current implementation base 10533b1e3f651a60e8cea5691318c108ff1f3396, whose intervening changes are unrelated. One-commit HEAD^..HEAD guards compare changed paths with each unchanged file-impact set.\n\nRead-back confirmed: tickets remain open; file-impact counts remain 11/16/18/4; verify counts are 7/7/7/11; the retired 9e65567 pin is absent; no description warning remains. No plan review, code edit, claim, transition, close, or push was performed outside rebar's normal ticket-event auto-push.","timestamp":1788619184562031783},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Mutation ledger — 2026-09-05\n\nUpdated four open planning tickets through the rebar MCP tracker surface; no claim, transition, plan review, code edit, test execution, commit, or push was performed.\n\n- `linguistic-dental-eyra`: replaced description with the immutable `0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e` 60-block/11-path audit, corrected rotation/unblock scopes and consumers, rewrote all 11 file-impact reasons, and recorded 6 DD-labeled verify commands.\n- `easy-crabbed-avocet`: replaced description with the immutable 3-block/3-path audit, separated five executable offline workflow nodes from two collection-only live Jira nodes