estamp":1788627830916143673},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Post-receipt currency clarification\n\nDuring the final local check, `origin/main` had advanced from the immutable audit basis `d6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84` to `88c90f8b5abf4a80be3b1289d7719d6e03e29684` via two test-only commits (`c668c0de97bf`, `88c90f8b5abf`). The code worktree itself remained clean and pinned at `d6669496…`.\n\nA read-only diff found 33 changed test/support paths and zero overlap with the 49 unique planned production-source paths. One stored focused command for `doddered-undercover-alligator` names a changed file, `tests/unit/test_secret_screen_e7a9.py`; its intervening edit only replaces direct `Path(rebar.__file__)` engine-root discovery with the canonical `engine_dir()` test helper. The test path and relevant assertions are unchanged.\n\nAccordingly, the immutable prose inventories, protected-line analysis, file impacts, and verification payloads remain valid and were not rewritten. Implementation should still begin from then-current `origin/main` in a fresh worktree; the immutable prose oracle intentionally retains `d6669496…` as its audited before-image.","timestamp":1788627940226842345},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Independent three-ticket delta audit completed against origin/main@`d6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84`.\n\nProven inventories and source boundaries:\n- `dripping-viperous-chickadee` (`a578-8751-ec4f-4369`): exactly 38 blocks across 10 paths (14 owner docstrings + 24 full-line comment regions). The prior 34/9 inventory remains exact, and `tests/unit/grounding/test_terraform_corroborator.py` adds exactly four independently validated comments at base lines 291-293, 308-309, 324-325, and 345-351. Its concise module docstring, line-23 mechanism/noqa marker, generated-script shebang/comment runtime content, concise line-322 baseline comment, and all unlisted prose/directives remain protected.\n- `lawyerly-chondrite-cowbird` (`7da2-4784-1379-42b8`): exactly 53 blocks across 8 paths (8 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 10 + 10 + 20 + 2). The Terraform source contribution is exactly two blocks: module docstring 1-8 and `_run` dot-directory rationale 286-291. The concise `corroborate` docstring at line 99 is excluded, and positive-only corroboration, snapshot isolation, executable provenance, and relative path/position safety remain explicit.\n- `conscious-deductive-jaeger` (`3198-d1b6-70f3-4f51`): exactly 72 blocks across 5 paths: container layers 20, Docker storage 19, journal 13, pct_of_cap 5, var_tmp 15. Every declared owner exists at its declared span, every non-owner span contains only full-line comment prose, and no non-allowlisted docstring/comment block at or above the audit threshold was found. The named concise exclusions (_df_rows, both _environment docstrings, two short pct_of_cap test docstrings, numeric-case inline comments, and the var_tmp timeout-stub comment) remain outside the map.\n\nDefects found and exact mutations:\n1. Dripping: `edit_ticket(description)`, `set_file_impact`, and `set_verify_commands`. Description is now 5,656 characters with the proven 38/10 scope and literal verification. File impact gained the Terraform test path with a contract-specific reason. The old five-command array was replaced by seven DD rows: immutable prose/AST/span oracle, exact leaf paths, focused tests, scoped Ruff, hygiene, diff integrity, and no-timeout repository verify. Every path-sensitive command includes all 10 paths. The semantic oracle now strips only allowlisted leading docstrings, normalizes only `ast.TypeIgnore.lineno`, compares exact attribute-free AST/runtime content, preserves protected physical directive/shebang lines, and confines zero-context hunks to the exact base spans.\n2. Lawyerly: `edit_ticket(description)` only. Description is now 5,833 characters, removes the accidental literal `\\n` path separator, states the validated two-block Terraform boundary, and includes concrete verification. The existing 8-path impact and six-command contract were independently checked and left unchanged.\n3. Conscious: `set_verify_commands` only. Description remains 6,885 characters and impact remains 5 paths. Only `immutable-prose-only` changed: the prior outer-double-quoted command passed literal `\\n` sequences to `python -c` and was syntactically invalid. The replacement uses real newlines, retains the exact validated 72-owner/span map, and preserves the other five commands byte-for-byte. Static zsh parsing and Python AST compilation pass for the repaired command arrays.\n\nAll five leaf writes returned `result=ok`, `push_status.state=ok`, no description warning, and no cross-session warning. Strict MCP readback matched every expected description, ordered impact array, and normalized command array exactly. All three remain `open`, `assignee=null`, and `attestations={}`.\n\nReadiness: all three planning records are structurally ready for a fresh plan review, but none is certified or claim-ready until a review passes. Per instruction, no plan review or other gate ran. No code edit, claim, transition, close, commit, or manual push occurred; the scoped code worktree remains clean at `d6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84`.","timestamp":1788628127421792624},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Fifth popular-stretchy-mussel plan-repair batch — 2026-09-05\n\nAudited and repaired the four remaining named unaudited leaves against the immutable code basis `origin/main@d6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84`. The isolated audit worktree `/Users/joeoakhart/comment-remediation-3e32` was clean and still at that exact commit; the moving `origin/main` ref was not substituted for the frozen basis.\n\nThe AST/token census considered all 1,114 true leading-docstring or maximal full